y in final position; after any invalid action, immediately consult valid actions and choose a move that advances the chain rather than retrying or looping on checks.', 'When When relocating a fixed set of objects between rooms with limited carrying capacity and a step limit, where some pick/drop actions may be invalid.: Keep an explicit checklist of delivered vs. remaining objects; after any invalid action, consult valid actions once and immediately execute a goal-advancing move; never retry the same invalid action or re-move already-delivered objects; verify each drop before traveling again.', "Act directly: output exactly ONE concrete executable action per turn. Do not output 'think:' steps; if you are unsure which actions are valid, output 'check valid actions'."]}
